Fire a psionic-enhanced shot at a foe doing [76%, 87%, 96%, 103%, 110% (TL1-5)] mind weapon damage and infecting it with a psy worm for 8 turns.

Each turn the worm will do [27, 36, 44, 50, 55 (TL1-5; MP 100)] mind damage and restore 1 psi to you, double if stunned or feared.

Also each turn the worm has 25% chances to spread to a nearby foe in radius 3.

When a creature infected by Psy Worm dies it spreads to all enemies in a radius of 3.
